# Personal overrides

Gitignored. Stacks on top of `CLAUDE.md` and never replaces it. Copy this file to `CLAUDE.local.md` and fill in the values for this machine.

## Local WordPress

`docker compose up -d` from the repo root. WordPress core and the database stay in Docker volumes. This repo is mounted at `wp-content/plugins/wp-radius-seo`. The site listens on http://127.0.0.1:8088 . Fill the lines below for this machine. Do not commit passwords.

